# Prettier owns .scss / .html / .md / .mdx / .yml.
# Biome owns .ts / .js / .json — see biome.json. The two scopes MUST stay
# disjoint: `nx format` is hardcoded to Prettier and cannot be pointed at
# Biome, so the only way to stop the two formatters fighting over libs/ui
# (tabs vs spaces, import sorting) is to keep them off each other's files.
*.ts
*.tsx
*.js
*.jsx
*.mjs
*.cjs
*.mts
*.cts
*.json
*.jsonc

